ugh final walkthrough, then the keys. Built to last, ready to live in.","Handover","03","Precision construction with regular updates and tight quality control. You're never wondering what's happening on site.","Build","02","We coordinate drawings, engineering, permits and selections — so you deal with us, not ten different people.","Design & Approvals","01","We start with a proper conversation — your site, your budget, what you actually want. No obligation, no jargon.","Sit-Down","464266286b7d","cardGrid",[142,143,144,145],"our values","WHAT DRIVES US",{"_123":155,"_124":-5,"_103":156,"_21":157},{"_123":152,"_124":-5,"_103":153,"_21":154},{"_123":149,"_124":-5,"_103":150,"_21":151},{"_123":146,"_124":-5,"_103":147,"_21":148},"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","We'd rather do it once, properly, than fast and twice. Our work is made to outlive the trend it was built in.","Built To Last","data:image/svg+xml;base64,","Your build, your decisions. We bring the expertise; you keep the control.","Partnership","data:image/svg+xml;base64,","Honest advice, honest pricing, honest updates — including when the news isn't what you hoped.","Straight Talk","data:image/svg+xml;base64,","The details you'll never notice are the ones we obsess over. That's the difference you feel for decades.","Precision","573b96e28f29","ourStory","OUR STORY",[203,204,205,206],[164,165,166,167],"light",{"_67":196,"_69":169,"_170":197,"_172":198,"_174":175},{"_67":189,"_69":169,"_170":190,"_172":191,"_174":175},{"_67":182,"_69":169,"_170":183,"_172":184,"_174":175},{"_67":168,"_69":169,"_170":171,"_172":173,"_174":175},"bb828e9dcf64","block","children",[176],"markDefs",[],"style","normal",{"_67":177,"_69":178,"_179":180,"_103":181},"564e4694262c","span","marks",[],"The name? It's our two boys, Sian and Ari. Building things that outlast us is personal here — it's literally over the door.","671d9db9f9f6",[185],[],{"_67":186,"_69":178,"_179":187,"_103":188},"7b07c5befcaa",[],"We only work with Grade-A tradespeople we trust, we keep you in the loop at every stage, and we're honest when plans change — because on a real build, they sometimes do. That openness is the whole reason clients refer us to the people they care about.","6f8c28212cff",[192],[],{"_67":193,"_69":178,"_179":194,"_103":195},"d735ebbf1b9b",[],"As the work got bigger, the standard didn't change. Today we deliver custom homes, bespoke designs, multi-dwelling developments and high-end renovations across Victoria — but every project still gets the same hands-on attention those first jobs did.","fb7dfdd57b41",[199],[],{"_67":200,"_69":178,"_179":201,"_103":202},"74739a093eb4",[],"Siari Build started where a lot of good builders start — on the tools. Small renovations in Melbourne's west, then our first two-unit sites, built for ourselves before we ever built them for clients.",{"_124":214,"_208":215},{"_124":212,"_208":213},{"_124":210,"_208":211},{"_124":207,"_208":209},"Licensed and insured","value","Fully","Design-to-handover","100%","Delivered","$20M+","YEARS building","14+","1be27d24e50d","heroInner","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/dbc2b4a5f032554b5f5aea0f2de731c02ecc52ce-4000x2500.jpg","About Us","BUILT ON DETAIL.","half","Fourteen years of doing it properly — architectural precision, real craftsmanship, and a builder who still walks every site.",{"_224":225,"_226":227,"_228":229,"_230":-5},"settings",{"_283":284,"_230":-5,"_285":286,"_287":288,"_289":290,"_291":-5,"_292":30,"_293":294,"_295":-5,"_296":297,"_298":252,"_299":-5,"_300":-5,"_301":252,"_302":303,"_304":305,"_306":307,"_308":309,"_310":-5,"_311":312,"_313":314,"_59":315,"_316":317,"_318":319},"navigation",{"_249":250,"_251":252,"_253":254,"_255":256},"services",[231,232,233,234,235,236],"businessImage",{"_103":247,"_21":248},{"_103":245,"_21":246},{"_103":243,"_21":244},{"_103":241,"_21":242},{"_103":239,"_21":240},{"_103":237,"_21":238},"Extra space for family, guests or rental income - designed and built properly, not bolted 