ere — moved, renamed, or never built. Let's get you back to solid ground.","phone","0419 000 991","Siari Build","tagline","Designed to Impress. Built to Last.","workingHours","Monday - Friday: 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM\nSaturday: 9:00 AM - 2:00 PM\nSunday: Closed","geopoint","alt",7,"lat",-37.895696,"lng",144.76186]
